/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 72 0 R
/E (The graduate certificate in geographic information sciences \(GISc\) at UNC-Chapel Hill developed my ability to investigate and model spatial data. My work focused on the interactions between infrastructure and nature. This is a showcase of several GIS projects, largely taken from my coursework. Beyond the geospatial analysis, I value engaging cartographic design and clear communication. Thank you for taking the time to explore my work.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
