/P 75 0 R
/E (The UNC Avian Society has been a part of a project to map bird window-strike fatalities on campus. Sightings are reported on iNaturalist. I downloaded this data and found a map of UNC buildings. Using ArcGIS Pro, I found the nearest building for each window-strike record. Then, the bird fatalities were counted up for each building.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5]
>>
