<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 76 0 R
/E (My map won first place in the competition! Plus, I received a lot of positive feedback. People mentioned that they liked the simplicity of the map, they found it easy to understand. They also enjoyed the extra layer of detail provided by the website. The Avian Society has been advocating for preventative measures against window-strikes around campus. My hope is that bringing this issue to a wider audience with clear recommendations will help build momentum for their efforts.)
