<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 80 0 R
/E (Exploration of monitoring sites across NC: Each point shows the average reading at that location across 10 years. Concentrations greater than 0.5 mL are considered hazardous to human and environmental health.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [6]
>>
